Difference Between npm and npx

| **npm**                                 | **npx**                                         
| --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- 
| Installs and manages packages.          | Runs packages without installing them globally. 
| Used for dependency management.         | Used to execute CLI tools.                      
| Example: `npm install @playwright/test` | Example: `npx playwright test`                  


NPX Commands
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| **Command**                                | **Purpose**                                                    
| -------------------------------------------| -------------------------------------------------------------- 
| npm init playwright@latest                 | Creates a new Playwright project.                              
| npx playwright install                     | Installs Playwright browsers (Chromium, Firefox, WebKit).      
| npx playwright --version                   | Shows the installed Playwright version.                        
| npx playwright test                        | Runs all test files in the project.                            
| npx playwright test login.spec.ts          | Runs a specific test file.                                     
| npx playwright test -g "Login Test"        | Runs a test by its title/name.                                 
| npx playwright test --grep "checkout"      | Runs tests matching a keyword or pattern.                      
| npx playwright test --project=chromium     | Runs tests only in the Chromium browser.                       
| npx playwright test --headed               | Runs tests with the browser visible.                           
| npx playwright test --debug                | Opens Playwright Inspector for debugging.                      
| npx playwright test --ui                   | Opens Playwright UI Mode to run and debug tests interactively. 
| npx playwright test --trace on             | Records a trace for every test execution.                      
| npx playwright codegen https://example.com | Records browser actions and generates Playwright code.         
| npx playwright show-report                 | Opens the HTML test report in the browser.                     
| npx playwright test --workers=1            | Runs tests one by one (sequentially).                          
| npx playwright test --last-failed          | Runs only the tests that failed in the previous run.           
| npx playwright test --list                 | Lists all available tests without running them.                
| npx playwright --help                      | Displays all Playwright CLI commands.                          
| npx playwright test --help                 | Displays all options available for the `test` command.         

NPM Commands
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| **Command**                   | **Purpose**                                     
| ------------------------------| ----------------------------------------------- 
| npm --version                 | Shows the installed npm version.                
| node --version                | Shows the installed Node.js version.            
| npm init                      | Creates a new `package.json` file.              
| npm init -y                   | Creates `package.json` with default values.     
| npm install                   | Installs all dependencies from `package.json`.  
| npm install <package-name>    | Installs a specific package.                    
| npm install -D <package-name> | Installs a package as a development dependency. 
| npm install -g <package-name> | Installs a package globally.                    
| npm uninstall <package-name>  | Removes a package.                              
| npm update                    | Updates installed packages.                     
| npm outdated                  | Shows packages that have updates available.     
| npm list                      | Lists installed packages.                       
| npm list -g                   | Lists globally installed packages.              
| npm cache clean --force       | Clears the npm cache.                           
| npm audit                     | Checks for security vulnerabilities.            
| npm audit fix                 | Fixes security vulnerabilities automatically.   
| npm run <script-name>         | Runs a script from `package.json`.              
| npm run test                  | Runs the `test` script.                         
| npm run build                 | Runs the `build` script.                        
| npm run start                 | Runs the `start` script.                        
| npm run dev                   | Runs the `dev` script (if available).           
| npm help                      | Shows npm help information.                     
| npm config list               | Displays npm configuration settings.            
| npm config get registry       | Shows the current npm registry URL.             
| npm config set registry <url> | Changes the npm registry URL.                   
